OL,3,GNEWSABus company U-turns on #594 school
OL,4,Aprice hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents angered by a #594 rise in the
OL,7,Fcost of their child's annual bus pass
OL,8,Fhave been offered a new rate after a
OL,9,Fbacklash.
OL,11,FThey faced paying #999 for the upcoming
OL,12,Facademic year - a rise from #405 - for
OL,13,Fthe 907 Central Connect route from West
OL,14,FBergholt to The Stanway School in
OL,15,Fnearby Colchester.
OL,17,FMother-of-two Katie Philp told the BBC
OL,18,Fshe felt like she was "drowning" with
OL,19,Flittle time to find the extra money.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
